  "description": "The perennial dreamer and aspiring composer, Nopara, has once again had his song credits stolen.  \n In a moment of contemplating giving up on his dreams, he gets into a traffic accident and, upon opening his eyes, finds himself in a university lecture room from ten years ago.   \nBefore him, laughing, is Lee Joo-hyuk, the son of the CEO of Lee Woo Entertainment, the one who stole his dream.   \nAlright! If I've been given a second chance, I'll bet everything and bring you down!!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=814596), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10111496)",
